      "sha256": "324424a0f9a618a34b843e2d99769dba9c350710edb99205f338cb1f29ffd022",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 4. Debugging outcomes for 14 participants in each condition. Co-Advisor: 0 failed, 0 guessed, 1 approached, 1 tried, 3 partially fixed, and 9 fixed. HowToo: 6 failed, 0 guessed, 5 approached, 3 tried, 0 partially fixed, and 0 fixed."
    },
    {
