      "sha256": "d29641e7bab55af8a4d508bd5f5ddae0a226eda8c158cfcb383a1944e8262bc0",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 5. Total debugging time for participants P1–P14. Every HowToo task reached the 15-minute limit, with no fixed or partially fixed outcomes. Co-Advisor times span approximately 2–15 minutes, with most below the limit; symbols show nine fixed, three partially fixed, one tried, and one approached. The accompanying text reports mean Co-Advisor time 10 minutes, standard deviation 3.6."
    },
