      "alt": "Figure 6. Grouped bars plot percentage of total task time spent learning or using the debugging strategy for participants P1–P14. Co-Advisor is 100 percent except P8, approximately 47 percent, and P10, approximately 87 percent. HowToo ranges from approximately 13 to 87 percent and is lower than Co-Advisor for every participant."
